dogecoin.text:
@VincentCrypt46 @elonmusk 😎

DOGE, or Dogecoin, is on the **Dogecoin blockchain**. It originally started as a fork of the Litecoin blockchain, which itself is a fork of Bitcoin. Hence, Dogecoin operates on its own independent blockchain.
Let’s do it! I’m sure @elonmusk had a plan when he designed it.
